WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.330
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:02.600 --> 00:06.000
National Radio and Television Administration

3
01:25.000 --> 01:30.000
Welcome to Pangjie Bathhouse.

4
01:52.479 --> 01:53.479
Director, we dug it up.

5
01:53.479 --> 01:54.210
Sister Long.

6
01:56.280 --> 01:56.759
Come.

7
01:57.360 --> 01:58.920
Wait. Get out of the way.

8
02:01.800 --> 02:02.680
Be careful.

9
02:05.320 --> 02:06.000
Really?

10
02:07.120 --> 02:08.520
It's just ordinary soil.

11
02:09.240 --> 02:11.970
Soil containing mercury doesn't look like this.

12
02:12.280 --> 02:13.560
Isn't there more underneath?

13
02:13.560 --> 02:15.400
What if it's one bag of soil and one bag of waste?

14
02:15.400 --> 02:16.320
Keep digging.

15
02:31.440 --> 02:33.000
This is all dirt too.

16
02:36.440 --> 02:37.840
Let's find all twenty spots.

17
02:37.840 --> 02:40.370
I refuse to believe we can't dig up this waste.

18
02:42.000 --> 02:44.240
Where did they go? How many of them?

19
02:44.240 --> 02:45.440
Keep an eye on them.

20
02:57.920 --> 02:59.360
Come on, get out.

21
03:00.640 --> 03:02.240
Do you even know how to drive?

22
03:03.560 --> 03:04.280
What are you yelling about?

23
03:04.280 --> 03:05.280
Did I hit you?

24
03:05.520 --> 03:06.920
It'd be too late if you hit me.

25
03:06.920 --> 03:08.040
You didn't even look at the intersection.

26
03:08.040 --> 03:09.280
You just rushed out.

27
03:09.280 --> 03:10.560
What do you mean rushed out?

28
03:10.560 --> 03:12.160
I have a dashcam in my car.

29
03:12.160 --> 03:13.920
It definitely recorded who hit who.

30
03:13.920 --> 03:15.200
Fine, let's call the police.

31
03:15.200 --> 03:16.520
Let the traffic police take a look.

32
03:16.520 --> 03:18.120
Look, I'll show you.

33
03:19.000 --> 03:22.079
You think you can run amok just because you drive a luxury car?

34
03:22.079 --> 03:23.760
Who do you think you are?

35
03:25.840 --> 03:27.170
What are you staring at?

36
03:40.520 --> 03:41.520
How is your leg?

37
03:42.920 --> 03:44.320
Not too good, boss.

38
03:44.960 --> 03:47.320
You hit it a bit too hard.

39
03:47.680 --> 03:50.400
The doctor said the nerve is injured.

40
03:50.760 --> 03:52.480
It needs time to heal.

41
03:53.560 --> 03:54.680
Don't worry.

42
03:55.280 --> 03:56.600
You helped me.

43
03:57.000 --> 03:58.440
I won't treat you badly.

44
04:00.000 --> 04:00.960
Thank you, boss.

45
04:01.760 --> 04:04.600
If the police come looking for you...

46
04:05.000 --> 04:06.800
Understood. Xiao Jun did it.

47
04:07.080 --> 04:08.680
I won't sell you out.

48
04:08.680 --> 04:10.960
Good. Good boy.

49
04:33.000 --> 04:34.000
Just the two of us?

50
04:36.280 --> 04:39.000
When you drink, it's merrier with more people.

51
04:39.680 --> 04:41.680
I want to talk to you alone.

52
04:43.800 --> 04:44.680
Alone?

53
04:50.280 --> 04:51.560
Alright, I know.

54
04:51.720 --> 04:53.280
I wronged you last time.

55
04:53.280 --> 04:54.560
They are just workers.

56
04:54.880 --> 04:57.159
We are brothers. Can't you see the relationship clearly?

57
04:57.159 --> 04:58.600
I see it very clearly.

58
04:58.600 --> 05:01.400
You're still so petty.

59
05:03.160 --> 05:03.840
Dali.

60
05:04.520 --> 05:05.560
I still remember,

61
05:06.160 --> 05:07.960
the first time I drank,

62
05:08.400 --> 05:09.720
it was with you.

63
05:09.720 --> 05:10.560
Exactly.

64
05:10.560 --> 05:12.760
We had no money in our pockets back then,

65
05:13.840 --> 05:15.960
and we were too embarrassed to ask our families for it.

66
05:15.960 --> 05:17.000
I remember.

67
05:17.000 --> 05:18.400
Then we went

68
05:18.560 --> 05:20.720
to help others in a gang fight to show support.

69
05:20.720 --> 05:22.400
No, at that time we just wanted to go

70
05:22.400 --> 05:23.600
strike a pose

71
05:24.000 --> 05:25.800
and earn an appearance fee, right?

72
05:25.800 --> 05:26.400
Yeah.

73
05:26.440 --> 05:28.160
Who knew those bastards were playing for real?

74
05:28.160 --> 05:30.080
They almost beat me to death.

75
05:30.800 --> 05:33.000
How much did they pay us for one fight back then?

76
05:33.000 --> 05:34.400
Fifty each.

77
05:34.880 --> 05:36.120
Fifty bucks.

78
05:36.120 --> 05:36.880
I can still remember.

79
05:36.880 --> 05:39.560
I clutched that money so hard it got all crumpled.

80
05:39.560 --> 05:42.000
Then we used that money to buy alcohol.

81
05:42.720 --> 05:44.080
And then I felt,

82
05:44.080 --> 05:46.920
the first sip had no taste.

83
05:48.120 --> 05:49.480
I had a wound in my mouth,

84
05:49.800 --> 05:51.400
and it stung so badly.

85
05:52.480 --> 05:54.400
And you were so loyal.

86
05:54.480 --> 05:56.800
You left the last sip of alcohol for me.

87
05:57.159 --> 05:58.040
Do you know why?

88
05:58.520 --> 06:00.120
Because it hurt me too.

89
06:10.720 --> 06:11.480
Back then,

90
06:12.920 --> 06:15.050
we had nothing, but it was really good.

91
06:15.280 --> 06:16.120
Exactly.

92
06:16.600 --> 06:19.330
So the day you came back from out of town to find me,

93
06:20.120 --> 06:22.120
I was so happy, really.

94
06:22.280 --> 06:23.120
I thought,

95
06:23.400 --> 06:25.480
we brothers are still meant to be.

96
06:26.600 --> 06:29.600
From now on, we can work hard and drink together again.

97
06:29.800 --> 06:30.480
Huzi.

98
06:34.240 --> 06:37.480
In the future, we will be able to afford all kinds of alcohol.

99
06:37.480 --> 06:39.480
There will be good days ahead, Huzi.

100
06:41.800 --> 06:42.280
Come on.

101
06:42.920 --> 06:43.850
Pour the drinks.

102
06:49.120 --> 06:50.680
Why are you shaking?

103
06:51.600 --> 06:52.600
Are you drunk?

104
06:54.800 --> 06:55.360
Dali.

105
06:57.280 --> 06:58.880
You should turn yourself in.

106
07:00.480 --> 07:01.360
What?

107
07:08.920 --> 07:09.720
Well...

108
07:11.120 --> 07:12.160
About Jun...

109
07:12.720 --> 07:13.780
I know everything.

110
07:16.280 --> 07:17.400
You committed intentional injury,

111
07:17.400 --> 07:19.260
and made your guy commit perjury.

112
07:19.760 --> 07:23.120
Too bad you forgot to delete the dashcam footage.

113
07:26.480 --> 07:28.480
Wait, they didn't wrong you.

114
07:30.720 --> 07:31.720
Wait, you...

115
07:31.840 --> 07:33.700
You really came here undercover?

116
07:35.360 --> 07:36.120
Dali.

117
07:37.800 --> 07:40.040
I can't watch you keep making mistakes.

118
07:40.600 --> 07:41.000
I...

119
07:41.360 --> 07:43.440
If you turn yourself in and confess,

120
07:43.600 --> 07:44.480
you can get a reduced sentence.

121
07:44.480 --> 07:46.159
Turn myself in, my ass!

122
07:46.720 --> 07:49.600
Dong Beihu, how have I wronged you?

123
07:49.720 --> 07:51.400
I gave you my car and my card.

124
07:51.400 --> 07:53.480
I let you manage my entire bathhouse.

125
07:53.720 --> 07:55.159
I gave you my all.

126
07:55.159 --> 07:57.600
And you're playing undercover with me here?

127
07:57.600 --> 07:58.720
I'm your brother.

128
07:59.480 --> 08:00.360
I'm saving you.

129
08:01.480 --> 08:02.360
Saving me?

130
08:02.720 --> 08:03.850
Saving me with this?

131
08:04.200 --> 08:06.560
Isn't this ruining me?

132
08:06.680 --> 08:08.320
I was like a dog out there.

133
08:08.320 --> 08:09.480
People looked down on me.

134
08:09.480 --> 08:11.960
I came back and finally made something of myself.

135
08:11.960 --> 08:13.620
I'm about to have everything.

136
08:13.920 --> 08:15.760
Fine, you want me to turn myself in.

137
08:15.760 --> 08:17.280
You want me to go to jail.

138
08:17.360 --> 08:18.920
Are you trying to ruin me?

139
08:20.960 --> 08:22.200
Some brother you are.

140
08:24.800 --> 08:25.480
Dong Beihu.

141
08:25.920 --> 08:27.120
From now on,

142
08:27.120 --> 08:28.720
we go our separate ways.

143
08:28.720 --> 08:30.360
We have nothing to do with each other.

144
08:30.360 --> 08:31.160
Get out.

145
09:38.360 --> 09:40.090
I will hold the sword of justice

146
09:40.120 --> 09:43.520
and seek justice for those who suffer injustice in the world.

147
09:44.120 --> 09:46.720
Then I will become the best lawyer in the world.

148
09:58.680 --> 09:59.800
We agreed back then.

149
09:59.800 --> 10:01.660
In the future, we will join forces

150
10:02.240 --> 10:04.170
and roam the world with our swords.

151
10:17.640 --> 10:18.880
Don't worry about Jun.

152
10:18.880 --> 10:20.210
I have the key evidence.

153
10:20.240 --> 10:21.480
He will definitely be fine.

154
10:21.480 --> 10:22.880
Just fight with peace of mind.

155
10:22.880 --> 10:24.410
What happened to your face?

156
10:26.000 --> 10:27.240
It's nothing. It's raining.

157
10:27.240 --> 10:29.040
The road is slippery, and I fell.

158
10:34.640 --> 10:35.480
Thank you.

159
10:36.480 --> 10:37.480
Don't mention it.

160
10:39.000 --> 10:39.720
Good luck.

161
11:00.720 --> 11:01.480
It's okay.

162
11:05.520 --> 11:06.180
Have a seat.

163
11:16.080 --> 11:18.760
Lawyer Wang is a great man.

164
11:19.320 --> 11:20.320
Sue Wan Gang.

165
11:21.000 --> 11:22.120
Sue Wan Gang.

166
11:22.240 --> 11:24.080
He's a good man. Let's go back and sit down.

167
11:24.080 --> 11:25.000
Please return to your seat, ma'am.

168
11:25.000 --> 11:25.880
Keep quiet.

169
11:26.120 --> 11:27.240
All rise.

170
11:28.720 --> 11:32.000
The presiding judge and judges will now take their seats.

171
11:38.200 --> 11:39.200
Please be seated.

172
11:42.360 --> 11:43.240
Appellant,

173
11:43.240 --> 11:45.880
please state your appeal requests and reasons.

174
11:45.880 --> 11:47.000
Yes, Your Honor.

175
11:47.200 --> 11:48.320
During the first trial,

176
11:48.320 --> 11:49.360
we suspected

177
11:49.360 --> 11:51.720
that the sewage discharge from Wangang Factory

178
11:51.720 --> 11:54.320
caused the death of the shrimp in the farm.

179
11:54.480 --> 11:57.540
However, through our further investigation, we found

180
11:57.600 --> 12:00.640
that our initial direction of investigation was wrong.

181
12:00.640 --> 12:02.240
The real source of pollution

182
12:02.360 --> 12:05.120
comes from Baizhao County, Leyang City,

183
12:05.120 --> 12:06.720
specifically Fuyuan Village.

184
12:06.720 --> 12:09.840
The mercury content in the village's groundwater seriously exceeds the standard.

185
12:09.840 --> 12:11.480
Last year's flood control project

186
12:11.480 --> 12:14.640
happened to change the flow of the village's groundwater.

187
12:14.640 --> 12:17.120
Thus, the mercury-contaminated groundwater,

188
12:17.120 --> 12:18.720
after being washed by heavy rain,

189
12:18.720 --> 12:21.240
flowed along the Baizhao River to the farm,

190
12:21.480 --> 12:24.360
causing huge losses to the farmers.

191
12:24.480 --> 12:25.000
So,

192
12:25.000 --> 12:27.240
where did the groundwater pollution in Fuyuan Village

193
12:27.240 --> 12:28.480
come from?

194
12:29.000 --> 12:32.120
This goes back 28 years.

195
12:32.600 --> 12:33.240
Back then, Wangang

196
12:33.240 --> 12:35.240
was still a small chemical factory,

197
12:35.480 --> 12:37.760
mainly engaged in the production and processing of polyvinyl chloride.

198
12:37.760 --> 12:38.760
And during this process,

199
12:38.760 --> 12:40.040
a catalyst called

200
12:40.040 --> 12:41.840
mercuric catalyst was needed.

201
12:41.960 --> 12:44.020
The waste generated by this catalyst

202
12:44.600 --> 12:46.080
is highly toxic

203
12:46.080 --> 12:47.680
and requires safe disposal.

204
12:48.320 --> 12:48.840
The factory director at that time,

205
12:48.840 --> 12:50.360
who is now Wan Jiliang,

206
12:50.360 --> 12:51.560
lined his own pockets

207
12:51.600 --> 12:53.000
and embezzled these public funds.

208
12:53.000 --> 12:55.520
He also sent people to bury the untreated mercury waste

209
12:55.520 --> 12:57.240
near Fuyuan Village.

210
12:57.560 --> 12:58.420
Over the years,

211
12:58.880 --> 13:01.400
this batch of waste slowly seeped into the ground.

212
13:01.400 --> 13:03.480
Eventually polluting the groundwater of Fuyuan Village.

213
13:03.480 --> 13:04.440
In 2002,

214
13:04.440 --> 13:07.570
Xue Lin, an employee in Wangang's production workshop,

215
13:07.640 --> 13:09.240
due to frequent miscarriages,

216
13:09.240 --> 13:11.370
suspected she had mercury poisoning,

217
13:11.600 --> 13:13.480
so she sued Wangang.

218
13:14.000 --> 13:16.480
Coincidentally, her lawyer at the time

219
13:16.480 --> 13:18.240
is the one sitting across from me right now,

220
13:18.240 --> 13:19.570
Attorney Wang Binghui.

221
13:19.640 --> 13:22.440
Attorney Wang is a great guy.

222
13:23.240 --> 13:24.360
sued Wan Gang.

223
13:24.360 --> 13:25.240
Objection.

224
13:26.720 --> 13:27.480
Your Honor,

225
13:27.480 --> 13:30.240
Xue Lin's lawsuit has nothing to do with this case.

226
13:30.240 --> 13:33.360
Moreover, in Xue Lin's lawsuit against Wan Gang back then,

227
13:33.360 --> 13:34.720
she lost the case.

228
13:35.200 --> 13:36.000
Facts have proven

229
13:36.000 --> 13:38.240
that there is no causal relationship

230
13:38.240 --> 13:40.000
between her miscarriage and Wan Gang.

231
13:40.000 --> 13:41.840
That's because Xue Lin made a mistake.

232
13:41.840 --> 13:44.120
She thought she was poisoned in Wangang,

233
13:44.600 --> 13:45.520
but in reality,

234
13:45.760 --> 13:47.600
she was poisoned in her hometown,

235
13:47.600 --> 13:49.200
Fuyuan Village.

236
13:49.840 --> 13:52.600
At that time, most of the villagers in Fuyuan Village

237
13:52.600 --> 13:54.080
got their daily water

238
13:54.080 --> 13:55.640
from a single well.

239
13:55.880 --> 13:57.080
In other words,

240
13:57.960 --> 14:00.820
Xue Lin wasn't the only one with mercury poisoning.

241
14:00.960 --> 14:04.220
Other villagers who used the same well were also affected.

242
14:04.240 --> 14:06.840
Some of them suffer from severe kidney disease

243
14:07.000 --> 14:09.240
and will need dialysis for the rest of their lives.

244
14:09.240 --> 14:10.900
Some have swollen knee joints

245
14:11.360 --> 14:13.240
and need crutches to walk.

246
14:13.880 --> 14:15.740
Some have suffered hearing loss.

247
14:16.240 --> 14:18.480
Some even got cancer

248
14:18.960 --> 14:20.600
and passed away early.

249
14:20.600 --> 14:21.360
Objection.

250
14:21.840 --> 14:23.360
The symptoms mentioned by the appellant

251
14:23.360 --> 14:26.000
could be related to family genetics, lifestyle,

252
14:26.000 --> 14:27.460
and working environment.

253
14:28.200 --> 14:30.360
These factors could all be relevant.

254
14:31.200 --> 14:33.600
It's far-fetched to insist

255
14:34.440 --> 14:35.880
on linking them to mercury poisoning.

256
14:35.880 --> 14:38.600
Last week, we specifically provided

257
14:38.720 --> 14:41.520
free testing for the villagers of Fuyuan Village,

258
14:41.840 --> 14:44.320
and no mercury residue was detected.

259
14:44.640 --> 14:46.120
It's been over 20 years.

260
14:46.840 --> 14:48.720
Even if there was mercury residue in their bodies,

261
14:48.720 --> 14:50.320
it would have been metabolized.

262
14:50.320 --> 14:51.080
Your Honor.

263
14:51.440 --> 14:52.240
At the same time,

264
14:52.240 --> 14:54.240
I would like to submit a groundwater test report.

265
14:54.240 --> 14:56.000
We have also provided a test report.

266
14:56.000 --> 14:57.240
Sorry to interrupt.

267
14:57.240 --> 14:58.480
My report

268
14:58.480 --> 15:00.080
is from 23 years ago,

269
15:00.120 --> 15:02.880
which was the fifth year after Wangang buried the waste.

270
15:02.880 --> 15:06.210
It was personally requested by you, Attorney Wang Binghui.

271
15:06.360 --> 15:07.490
Have you forgotten?

272
15:08.600 --> 15:09.480
Actually, it's not that

273
15:09.480 --> 15:11.760
no one noticed the abnormality in Fuyuan Village.

274
15:11.760 --> 15:12.620
Director Wang,

275
15:12.720 --> 15:13.360
also known as Wang Binghui,

276
15:13.360 --> 15:15.480
the defense lawyer for Xue Lin's case back then.

277
15:15.480 --> 15:17.010
He was very close back then,

278
15:17.640 --> 15:19.640
and might have even found the truth.

279
15:20.080 --> 15:20.480
In the 2000s,

280
15:20.480 --> 15:21.840
there weren't many testing agencies.

281
15:21.840 --> 15:22.600
Fortunately,

282
15:22.600 --> 15:24.720
this agency kept this report.

283
15:25.720 --> 15:26.840
But unfortunately,

284
15:26.840 --> 15:29.480
you were bribed by Wan Jiliang during Xue Lin's case.

285
15:29.480 --> 15:31.120
Deliberately concealed this report.

286
15:31.120 --> 15:32.360
So this test report

287
15:32.480 --> 15:33.520
was not used back then

288
15:33.520 --> 15:34.840
as key evidence in Xue Lin's case

289
15:34.840 --> 15:36.370
and submitted to the court.

290
15:36.440 --> 15:38.170
Leading to the loss of the case.

291
15:38.240 --> 15:40.640
Then how did you think of looking into this?

292
15:42.360 --> 15:43.560
Because I found this.

293
15:44.160 --> 15:45.120
This is Wangang's report

294
15:45.120 --> 15:48.180
on the tap water renovation project in Fuyuan Village.

295
15:48.480 --> 15:50.120
The handwriting of the annotations on it

296
15:50.120 --> 15:51.840
It's exactly the same as Director Wang's.

297
15:51.840 --> 15:53.170
Actually, for this tea,

298
15:53.480 --> 15:54.740
the flavor it produces

299
15:55.080 --> 15:58.000
depends on the person who brews it.

300
15:59.320 --> 16:00.360
This also means

301
16:00.600 --> 16:03.360
Director Wang helped Wan Jiliang in Xue Lin's case,

302
16:03.360 --> 16:04.360
and also helped him

303
16:04.360 --> 16:06.480
resolve the hidden danger of mercury waste,

304
16:06.480 --> 16:09.540
by having him fund tap water access for Fuyuan Village.

305
16:10.000 --> 16:12.240
I think you can guess the reason.

306
16:12.240 --> 16:14.360
According to Wangang's corporate ledger,

307
16:14.360 --> 16:15.600
in 1997,

308
16:16.200 --> 16:19.360
Wangang produced a total of 62 tons of mercury catalyst waste.

309
16:19.360 --> 16:21.840
And the company's expenses for harmless treatment

310
16:21.840 --> 16:23.520
reached 1.2 million.

311
16:23.720 --> 16:24.650
All the receipts

312
16:25.840 --> 16:26.700
have been kept.

313
16:26.880 --> 16:27.840
This proves that

314
16:27.840 --> 16:28.720
all the waste

315
16:28.720 --> 16:30.720
was properly disposed of.

316
16:30.720 --> 16:32.720
If, as Attorney Xiao said,

317
16:33.120 --> 16:36.240
mercury waste is buried under Fuyuan Village,

318
16:36.480 --> 16:39.120
then may I ask where it is buried?

319
16:39.120 --> 16:42.000
Wangang took the opportunity of developing Fuyuan Village

320
16:42.000 --> 16:43.480
to transfer the waste.

321
16:43.480 --> 16:44.740
Where is the evidence?

322
16:48.600 --> 16:51.000
I understand the situation.

323
16:51.720 --> 16:53.050
What do you want me to do?

324
16:53.280 --> 16:55.720
Mr. Sun, you are the supervisor of the group.

325
16:55.720 --> 16:58.360
You said you would supervise the group's legal and compliant operations.

326
16:58.360 --> 16:59.480
So I hope you

327
17:00.120 --> 17:02.720
can persuade the board members as soon as possible

328
17:02.720 --> 17:05.359
to proactively go to the police on behalf of the group

329
17:05.359 --> 17:06.690
and report Wan Jiliang.

330
17:14.359 --> 17:15.359
Lawyer Li.

331
17:17.720 --> 17:19.650
I can't call you Lawyer Li anymore.

332
17:20.160 --> 17:22.240
You've been suspended.

333
17:35.120 --> 17:37.840
Your Honor, I request a recess.

334
17:38.120 --> 17:38.840
Objection.

335
17:39.120 --> 17:41.480
This is a deliberate procedural delay.

336
17:41.480 --> 17:43.200
Your Honor, members of the collegial panel,

337
17:43.200 --> 17:45.480
I will provide crucial evidence shortly.

338
17:45.480 --> 17:46.440
For both this case

339
17:46.440 --> 17:48.120
and the case from 28 years ago,

340
17:48.120 --> 17:49.440
it is extremely important.

341
17:49.440 --> 17:52.000
I hope Your Honor can give me some time.

342
17:56.120 --> 17:56.880
Appellant.

343
17:57.720 --> 17:59.760
The court grants your request for a recess.

344
17:59.760 --> 18:01.480
But if after the recess,

345
18:01.480 --> 18:03.760
you have no new evidence to submit,

346
18:04.000 --> 18:06.240
we will proceed with the normal trial procedure

347
18:06.240 --> 18:07.600
and continue the hearing.

348
18:07.600 --> 18:09.860
The court is now in recess for 15 minutes.

349
18:11.000 --> 18:12.330
How's the search going?

350
18:12.520 --> 18:13.980
We didn't dig up anything.

351
18:14.320 --> 18:15.440
A bunch of us were digging there.

352
18:15.440 --> 18:16.360
But we found nothing.

353
18:16.360 --> 18:18.760
Yes, Director. There are 20 spots in total.

354
18:18.840 --> 18:21.240
We dug 16 of them with Uncle Jingang.

355
18:21.480 --> 18:22.240
It was all dirt.

356
18:22.240 --> 18:23.900
We didn't see any waste at all.

357
18:25.720 --> 18:27.480
This is not your style.

358
18:28.080 --> 18:29.600
It's too mild.

359
18:30.720 --> 18:31.600
I thought

360
18:31.600 --> 18:34.440
you would definitely prepare some trump cards.

361
18:37.480 --> 18:38.740
Mr. Wan, you are right.

362
18:39.240 --> 18:40.640
To convince the board,

363
18:41.240 --> 18:43.240
we indeed need to be fully prepared.

364
18:50.800 --> 18:53.160
Regarding the second trial of the farmers' case,

365
18:53.160 --> 18:54.240
are you confident?

366
18:54.920 --> 18:57.240
Xiao Longnv was also trained by me.

367
18:57.480 --> 18:59.080
Sorry, I need to take a call.

368
18:59.760 --> 19:02.280
I know exactly what she's capable of.

369
19:03.960 --> 19:05.800
As long as they can't find the waste,

370
19:05.800 --> 19:07.730
she won't be able to make any waves.

371
19:08.680 --> 19:09.480
Don't worry.

372
19:10.200 --> 19:11.800
It's already being handled.

373
19:11.920 --> 19:13.440
They won't find it.

374
19:16.200 --> 19:17.200
Attorney Guo Jin.

375
19:18.040 --> 19:18.700
Bluetooth.

376
19:20.200 --> 19:21.480
Before I became a senior partner,

377
19:21.480 --> 19:23.480
he had been working on cases with me.

378
19:24.480 --> 19:26.000
So whether he's telling the truth or lying,

379
19:26.000 --> 19:27.200
I can tell at a glance.

380
19:27.720 --> 19:28.560
I've finished organizing it.

381
19:28.560 --> 19:29.890
You just need to sign it.

382
19:42.760 --> 19:43.440
Lawyer Li.

383
19:45.440 --> 19:46.520
The document...

384
19:47.080 --> 19:48.520
seems to have a problem.

385
19:48.520 --> 19:51.160
I'll check it again.

386
19:52.480 --> 19:53.200
Bluetooth.

387
19:53.800 --> 19:56.400
If I don't sign this contract,

388
19:57.480 --> 19:59.740
how will you explain it to Director Wang?

389
20:01.720 --> 20:03.160
I also made him choose.

390
20:04.280 --> 20:05.040
Just like when you made

391
20:05.040 --> 20:07.320
Lawyer Wang Binghui choose.

392
20:07.800 --> 20:08.800
But fortunately,

393
20:09.480 --> 20:10.680
he didn't let me down.

394
20:21.440 --> 20:24.570
You think you can bring me down with just this recording?

395
20:25.040 --> 20:27.200
When I founded Wangang,

396
20:27.560 --> 20:30.160
the whole factory was only about 2,000 square meters,

397
20:30.160 --> 20:32.090
and we had no more than ten workers.

398
20:32.760 --> 20:33.720
Look at it now.

399
20:34.240 --> 20:37.640
Just one workshop in the new factory is over 10,000 square meters.

400
20:37.640 --> 20:40.040
Without me, there would be no Wangang,

401
20:40.320 --> 20:42.200
let alone the current Xingang.

402
20:43.040 --> 20:45.640
You just don't have the vision your master had.

403
20:48.320 --> 20:49.080
Mr. Wan.

404
20:50.000 --> 20:51.320
Are you so sure

405
20:52.800 --> 20:55.530
that Director Wang can definitely win this case?

406
20:56.040 --> 20:58.080
Or are you 100% certain

407
20:59.080 --> 21:01.940
that the waste materials will never be discovered?

408
21:02.080 --> 21:04.200
I advise you not to be so optimistic.

409
21:04.760 --> 21:06.290
The seed planted years ago,

410
21:08.280 --> 21:10.040
as long as it breaks through the soil,

411
21:10.040 --> 21:11.570
it will definitely sprout.

412
21:12.760 --> 21:14.720
So from the day Fuyuan Village was developed,

413
21:14.720 --> 21:17.120
I knew the waste would definitely be found.

414
21:18.160 --> 21:19.490
You don't know your son.

415
21:20.720 --> 21:22.520
But I know Lawyer Xiao very well.

416
21:23.080 --> 21:25.240
She will definitely win this battle.

417
21:26.480 --> 21:28.720
Then you need to dig the front part all over again.

418
21:28.720 --> 21:30.000
1997.

419
21:30.240 --> 21:33.160
Wangang produced a total of 62 tons of mercury catalyst waste.

420
21:33.160 --> 21:33.960
Aren't there four left?

421
21:33.960 --> 21:35.240
Hurry up and dig those four.

422
21:35.240 --> 21:36.080
For the previous 16,

423
21:36.080 --> 21:37.240
dig a little deeper.

424
21:37.240 --> 21:38.520
Alright, stop digging.

425
21:38.520 --> 21:39.320
What's wrong?

426
21:39.320 --> 21:40.450
We've been tricked.

427
21:41.160 --> 21:42.800
I remember Wan Zhuoli

428
21:42.800 --> 21:45.400
drove five dump trucks into Fuyuan Village.

429
21:45.560 --> 21:48.000
Each truck has a capacity of 15 tons,

430
21:48.000 --> 21:49.680
which adds up to 75 tons.

431
21:49.800 --> 21:51.520
You've dug 16 spots now,

432
21:51.520 --> 21:54.400
and the real soil adds up to about 50 tons.

433
21:54.400 --> 21:56.400
With the remaining 25 tons of capacity,

434
21:56.400 --> 21:57.720
how could it possibly hold

435
21:57.720 --> 21:59.160
62 tons of real waste?

436
21:59.160 --> 22:01.160
Then where did the waste go?

437
22:01.160 --> 22:02.520
If I'm not mistaken,

438
22:02.720 --> 22:04.720
the real waste is still in Fuyuan Village.

439
22:04.720 --> 22:05.800
What?

440
22:06.480 --> 22:08.160
Wan Zhuoli tricked us all.

441
22:08.160 --> 22:11.080
He probably dug up the real waste,

442
22:11.320 --> 22:12.780
but he didn't take it away.

443
22:13.080 --> 22:15.240
He covered the waste with soil,

444
22:15.400 --> 22:17.640
making us think it was dug away.

445
22:18.480 --> 22:18.800
Then, sister,

446
22:18.800 --> 22:21.080
what should we do now?

447
22:21.320 --> 22:23.040
You guys hurry to Fuyuan Village now.

448
22:23.040 --> 22:24.640
We don't have much time left.

449
22:25.200 --> 22:26.160
Director, we'll go right now.

450
22:26.160 --> 22:27.420
Yes, hurry up. Come on.

451
22:27.480 --> 22:28.280
Appellant.

452
22:28.680 --> 22:31.480
Do you have any new evidence to submit to the court?

453
22:38.720 --> 22:39.640
Your Honor.

454
22:45.000 --> 22:47.200
Before I present the new evidence,

455
22:48.040 --> 22:51.200
I would like to say a few words to the opposing counsel.

456
22:51.560 --> 22:52.240
May I?

457
22:52.480 --> 22:53.240
You may.

458
22:54.520 --> 22:56.520
On my first day in this profession,

459
22:58.240 --> 22:59.760
you taught us that

460
23:00.440 --> 23:01.640
as a lawyer,

461
23:03.440 --> 23:05.480
one must harbor a love for justice

462
23:06.560 --> 23:09.880
and be dedicated to the pursuit of truth and fairness.

463
23:11.920 --> 23:14.000
I believe you were sincere back then.

464
23:14.640 --> 23:15.770
When you were young,

465
23:16.160 --> 23:18.420
you were also passionate and impulsive.

466
23:19.640 --> 23:20.720
You also believe

467
23:21.480 --> 23:25.440
that the law can forge a path for the weak.

468
23:25.960 --> 23:28.520
I told you not to take this case.

469
23:28.520 --> 23:29.680
You can't win.

470
23:29.920 --> 23:31.600
Our law firm is just starting out.

471
23:31.600 --> 23:33.040
Don't ask for trouble.

472
23:34.240 --> 23:34.840
Director.

473
23:36.160 --> 23:37.760
We can't be afraid of losing.

474
23:38.120 --> 23:39.280
I've already found the evidence.

475
23:39.280 --> 23:41.800
You don't understand what I'm saying, do you?

476
23:41.800 --> 23:42.480
But...

477
23:43.640 --> 23:46.040
Persistence doesn't put food on the table.

478
23:46.480 --> 23:48.720
Should we compromise with reality?

479
23:49.520 --> 23:52.400
This is a required lesson for every young lawyer.

480
23:53.960 --> 23:56.800
Temptation is often like a vine.

481
23:57.480 --> 23:59.800
When a crack appears in human nature,

482
24:00.320 --> 24:02.160
it quietly creeps up.

483
24:02.760 --> 24:03.680
You think it just

484
24:03.680 --> 24:05.560
gently tugs at your hem,

485
24:06.240 --> 24:07.720
but when you look back,

486
24:08.720 --> 24:11.050
it has already entangled your whole body.

487
24:12.560 --> 24:15.360
Life's choices are often made in a single thought.

488
24:16.520 --> 24:18.560
It's like dominoes.

489
24:18.920 --> 24:20.560
When the first one falls,

490
24:20.960 --> 24:23.960
the rest of your defenses will also collapse.

491
24:30.080 --> 24:31.810
I would like to ask Lawyer Wang.

492
24:34.560 --> 24:36.920
What kind of temptation

493
24:38.080 --> 24:39.240
would make such an

494
24:39.440 --> 24:42.040
idealistic and ambitious lawyer

495
24:42.960 --> 24:45.420
choose to abandon their original intention

496
24:46.320 --> 24:48.560
and violate their professional beliefs?

497
24:48.560 --> 24:49.480
Lawyer Xiao,

498
24:49.920 --> 24:51.280
you are my apprentice.

499
24:52.240 --> 24:54.770
I taught you when you entered the profession.

500
24:54.920 --> 24:57.720
The law speaks with evidence.

501
24:58.080 --> 24:58.920
In law,

502
24:59.560 --> 25:01.090
facts that cannot be proven

503
25:01.560 --> 25:03.290
are considered non-existent.

504
25:04.480 --> 25:06.340
No matter how well a story is told,

505
25:06.960 --> 25:08.240
it is just a story.

506
25:15.320 --> 25:16.080
Your Honor,

507
25:16.480 --> 25:19.240
the appellant's statement has consistently been irrelevant to this case.

508
25:19.240 --> 25:21.480
I request to terminate her statement.

509
25:21.800 --> 25:22.800
Request granted.

510
25:35.960 --> 25:36.760
Appellant,

511
25:36.960 --> 25:39.480
if there is no new evidence to submit to the court,

512
25:39.480 --> 25:42.480
we will proceed to the court debate stage.

513
25:46.720 --> 25:49.180
Your Honor, members of the collegial panel,

514
25:51.480 --> 25:53.040
we are sitting here today

515
25:53.240 --> 25:55.760
not only for my client, Lao Pan,

516
25:55.760 --> 25:56.800
to demand an explanation,

517
25:56.800 --> 26:00.320
but also to seek justice for the deceived

518
26:00.680 --> 26:03.040
and injured villagers of Fuyuan Village.

519
26:04.320 --> 26:06.080
The villagers of Fuyuan Village

520
26:06.080 --> 26:07.560
have the right to know

521
26:07.960 --> 26:10.240
why they got sick

522
26:10.560 --> 26:13.560
and why their relatives died.

523
26:13.880 --> 26:15.000
The farmers

524
26:15.240 --> 26:16.700
also have the right to know

525
26:16.720 --> 26:20.080
why their fish and shrimp died.

526
26:30.000 --> 26:30.760
Hurry up.

527
26:33.280 --> 26:33.940
Who are you?

528
26:34.240 --> 26:35.280
You can't come in here.

529
26:35.280 --> 26:36.340
Go away. Leave now.

530
26:36.440 --> 26:37.440
Leave now. Come on.

531
26:37.440 --> 26:37.920
Leave now. Somebody!

532
26:37.920 --> 26:38.760
Hurry.

533
26:38.880 --> 26:39.520
Hurry.

534
26:39.520 --> 26:40.240
Hurry. Take it away.

535
26:40.240 --> 26:40.880
Go.

536
26:41.000 --> 26:42.000
Hurry up. You two, push hard.

537
26:42.000 --> 26:44.440
We ordinary people have the right

538
26:44.680 --> 26:47.760
to know if the land we live on day and night,

539
26:48.480 --> 26:50.440
every drop of water we drink,

540
26:50.920 --> 26:53.000
every bite of food we eat,

541
26:53.240 --> 26:55.280
and every breath of air we take

542
26:55.440 --> 26:57.000
are safe

543
26:57.240 --> 26:58.640
and free of problems.

544
26:59.000 --> 27:01.400
This is a right granted to us by law.

545
27:04.200 --> 27:05.260
What are you doing?

546
27:05.560 --> 27:06.800
Quick, catch her!

547
27:07.800 --> 27:10.480
Anyone, any enterprise...

548
27:10.680 --> 27:13.480
You can't trample on the law for profit,

549
27:14.040 --> 27:16.680
strip away rights, and cover up the truth.

550
27:17.320 --> 27:19.180
Whether it's Wangang or Xingang,

551
27:19.480 --> 27:20.760
what parents

552
27:21.240 --> 27:23.770
don't want their children to grow up healthy?

553
27:24.960 --> 27:28.280
So you wouldn't want to see the giant ship, Xingang,

554
27:28.880 --> 27:31.140
hit an iceberg right after leaving port.

555
27:35.160 --> 27:36.960
Don't. Don't arrest her.

556
27:36.960 --> 27:38.120
Hurry! After them!

557
27:38.120 --> 27:38.450
Stop.

558
27:38.480 --> 27:40.120
I've already called the police.

559
27:40.120 --> 27:42.250
I'm telling you, I'm an intern lawyer.

560
27:42.520 --> 27:44.250
We've collected the evidence.

561
27:44.480 --> 27:45.200
Got all the evidence!

562
27:45.200 --> 27:45.920
Don't run! Stop!

563
27:45.920 --> 27:46.960
Because the law

564
27:47.000 --> 27:48.720
is the last line of defense for us ordinary people

565
27:48.720 --> 27:51.000
to protect ourselves.

566
27:51.000 --> 27:52.000
Run, Miaomiao!

567
27:53.280 --> 27:54.160
There's no signal here.

568
27:54.160 --> 27:55.560
I'll hold them off for you.

569
27:55.560 --> 27:56.890
Run quickly, Miaomiao!

570
27:57.880 --> 27:58.560
Your Honor.

571
27:58.880 --> 27:59.320
Run.

572
27:59.640 --> 28:02.080
The opposing counsel keeps stalling for time.

573
28:02.080 --> 28:03.800
I believe she is exploiting the procedure

574
28:03.800 --> 28:06.860
to interfere with judicial justice. Give me the phone.

575
28:08.080 --> 28:08.720
Found it.

576
28:09.040 --> 28:10.160
We found the evidence.

577
28:10.160 --> 28:12.220
The waste is still in Fuyuan Village.

578
28:25.440 --> 28:26.200
Mr. Wan.

579
28:27.760 --> 28:29.280
The waste has been found.

580
28:30.760 --> 28:32.520
Before the police find you,

581
28:33.080 --> 28:35.080
you still have time to make a choice.

582
28:35.320 --> 28:37.520
Will you continue to take your chances

583
28:38.560 --> 28:41.360
and let decades of your hard work go down the drain,

584
28:42.000 --> 28:43.520
or will you choose to turn yourself in,

585
28:43.520 --> 28:45.520
cut ties with the group,

586
28:46.480 --> 28:49.400
and keep this big ship from sinking?

587
28:49.880 --> 28:51.800
Don't think you've won.

588
28:56.480 --> 28:58.480
I'm not here today to win or lose.

589
28:58.760 --> 29:00.020
Of course, in my heart,

590
29:00.960 --> 29:02.820
Wangang will always be my client.

591
29:03.080 --> 29:04.080
As a lawyer,

592
29:05.400 --> 29:07.200
within the framework of the law,

593
29:08.240 --> 29:10.640
finding the optimal solution for my client

594
29:11.680 --> 29:12.960
is my true purpose.

595
29:16.640 --> 29:19.560
Based on the latest evidence provided by the plaintiff,

596
29:19.560 --> 29:22.240
this case may involve criminal offenses.

597
29:22.720 --> 29:24.560
After deliberation by the collegial panel,

598
29:24.560 --> 29:27.160
the civil trial of this case is terminated.

599
29:27.480 --> 29:31.160
Transferred to the public security authorities for investigation.

600
29:31.160 --> 29:32.290
Court is adjourned.

601
29:33.720 --> 29:40.240
Good, good, good.

602
29:40.240 --> 29:41.200
That's great.

603
29:41.320 --> 29:43.000
Good.

604
29:43.280 --> 29:48.480
Great, great.

605
30:13.920 --> 30:15.920
I didn't lose to you and Xiao Longnv.

606
30:17.640 --> 30:18.920
I just

607
30:21.480 --> 30:22.680
lost to fate.

608
30:24.320 --> 30:25.720
If it weren't for

609
30:26.200 --> 30:29.320
the Baizhao River changing course and polluting the farm,

610
30:29.320 --> 30:31.520
I would have kept walking down this path

611
30:32.480 --> 30:33.810
until the end of my life.

612
30:34.400 --> 30:35.480
I never understood

613
30:37.000 --> 30:38.240
why you did this.

614
30:38.680 --> 30:40.880
If I had chosen to help Xue Lin back then,

615
30:41.640 --> 30:43.640
I might still be a failure today,

616
30:44.920 --> 30:47.180
unable to even support my wife and child.

617
30:48.520 --> 30:49.640
At that time,

618
30:50.920 --> 30:53.920
who would have paid for my narrow sense of justice?

619
30:55.720 --> 30:58.720
Look, I built Honghu single-handedly.

620
30:59.520 --> 31:02.320
I gave many people a comfortable life.

621
31:02.720 --> 31:06.040
This is something that poor boy could never achieve in several lifetimes.

622
31:06.040 --> 31:07.370
You can't get it either.

623
31:07.960 --> 31:09.640
But the path you chose

624
31:11.320 --> 31:13.240
came at the expense of others.

625
31:13.440 --> 31:14.880
But I helped more people.

626
31:15.480 --> 31:16.240
True.

627
31:18.240 --> 31:20.680
Individual sacrifice is regrettable,

628
31:21.760 --> 31:24.760
but justice for the majority is more important.

629
31:25.760 --> 31:28.960
If you were me back then,

630
31:29.720 --> 31:31.250
what would you have chosen?

631
31:33.040 --> 31:34.080
Saying 'I had no choice'

632
31:34.080 --> 31:35.400
sounds tragic,

633
31:35.960 --> 31:37.240
but it's just a self-glorifying

634
31:37.240 --> 31:38.480
moral sanctuary.

635
31:39.000 --> 31:41.680
If you hadn't taken a shortcut back then,

636
31:42.160 --> 31:44.090
and instead persuaded Wan Jiliang

637
31:44.720 --> 31:46.320
to dig out the waste early

638
31:46.760 --> 31:49.090
to prevent the pollution from worsening,

639
31:49.480 --> 31:52.610
things definitely wouldn't have ended like this today.

640
31:55.000 --> 31:55.800
Some paths,

641
31:58.480 --> 31:59.540
once you go too far,

642
32:01.040 --> 32:02.480
there's no turning back.

643
32:06.680 --> 32:07.560
Master.

644
32:10.320 --> 32:12.050
Even though you made a mistake,

645
32:12.320 --> 32:14.040
you will always be my master.

646
32:16.560 --> 32:18.240
To speak for the voiceless.

647
32:20.720 --> 32:22.720
To wield a sword for the shieldless.

648
32:23.240 --> 32:24.900
Although I don't often say it,

649
32:26.400 --> 32:27.880
this is what you taught me.

650
32:41.480 --> 32:42.680
Are you Wang Binghui?

651
32:44.760 --> 32:46.240
This is a detention notice.

652
32:46.240 --> 32:47.370
Please come with us.

653
32:57.400 --> 32:58.040
Li Xin.

654
33:01.440 --> 33:04.640
I'll leave Honghu to you.

